1. First install dbmate (https://github.com/amacneil/dbmate) on your system.

2.
On terminal tab 1 from project root:
$ source .venv/bin/activate
$ flask --app task_manager init-db  # first time only
$ dbmate up     # run migrations
$ flask --app task_manager run --debug

On terminal tab 2:
$ http POST 127.0.0.1:5000/api/tasks title="Go to cinema with Anurag at 5 PM"
HTTP/1.1 201 CREATED
Connection: close
Content-Length: 139
Content-Type: application/json
Date: Sat, 02 May 2026 06:22:38 GMT
Server: Werkzeug/3.1.8 Python/3.12.3

{
    "message": "Task added successfully",
    "task_id": 14,
    "task_status": "pending",
    "task_title": "Go to cinema with Anurag at 5 PM"
}


